  "content": "\n\n<p align=\"center\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1f83bc51751dc611a40323ba357aabbb821ccf9c.png\" alt=\"frame1\" /> </p>\n\n**<center><font size=\"4\">《吃東西動畫模組》現在變成材質包了！</center>**\n\n<center> <a href='https://modrinth.com/mod/eating-animation'>--> 《吃東西動畫模組》 <--</a> </center>\n\n<p align=\"center\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/45e2627dbc9ecdcf4c9536d0f2c13ace0295dad7.png\" alt=\"frame2\" /> </p>\n\n<center>為可食用與可飲用物品新增精靈動畫的材質包。\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OhzX8kDf/images/dcfae4a8fcaba12d522af8314b709d084c45a891.gif\" alt=\"drawing\" width=\"300\"/>\n\n<p align=\"center\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/963c8ee786e7020bc82536c65883acbb54686efe.png\" alt=\"frame3\" /> </p>\n\n只需下載並啟用此資源包，即可在無需安裝模組的情況下擁有動態食物 :)\n![Guide](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/OhzX8kDf/images/dbc8c982ab0f6b1bc69a4f4dcb73ecf9be5b95ce.png)\n\n<p align=\"center\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7adbddf1ea62610623c4fb85115ecbc03133351f.png\" alt=\"frame4\" /> </p>",
